            'The non-gravitational acceleration is caused by interactions between \'Oumuamua\'s hypothetical magnetic field and the interplanetary magnetic field; as the solar wind\'s magnetic field lines connected to \'Oumuamua\'s conducting interior, magnetic tension in the draped field lines created a net anti-sunward force analogous to magnetospheric drag on a satellite; the acceleration magnitude is consistent with a conducting body of \'Oumuamua\'s estimated dimensions interacting with the measured solar wind magnetic field at 0.255 AU',
